+### Phase 3 ΓÇö the finalized transaction ordering contract
+
+**The Phase 2 schema omitted `transactions.created_at` entirely** ΓÇö every other table had one,
+but `transactions` did not. **Phase 3's deterministic-ordering review exposed the gap**: without
+it, same-day transactions had no real tie-break and `ORDER BY date DESC, id ASC` alone would have
+ordered tied rows by UUID. Phase 3 amended the schema to add `transactions.created_at` (see the
+table in ┬º4), and `lib/data/transactions.ts` was updated to sort `date DESC, created_at DESC, id
+ASC` (the mock
